  "title": "· New Arrival | Miu Miu Unveils the Fall/Winter 206 Ivy Bag: A Horizontal Tote in Earthy Tones ·",
  "original_title": "新包 | Miu Miu 上架206秋冬新款 Ivy 手袋：横向托特包，大地色系",
  "excerpt": "Miu Miu debuts the Ivy tote for Fall 2026, blending Ivy League nostalgia with earthy tones and drawstring details.",
  "author": "撰稿 X LING 编辑 X VIVI",
  "date_iso": "2026-08-28",
  "date_label": "August 28, 2026",
