    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This week, Miu Miu unveils the new Ivy handbag for Fall/Winter 2026, continuing its signature relaxed, open-top tote silhouette with a curved opening. The name is a nod to the American Ivy League universities. The standout feature this season is the horizontal orientation, accented by drawstring side ties, and rendered in earthy heather wood and oak tones that exude a vintage, literary charm.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
