      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Horizontal Silhouette ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The new shopper adopts a spacious, three-dimensional horizontal structure—measuring 30cm high, 40cm wide, and 15cm deep. The cut remains a highlight: the curved top edge and twin top handles cleverly form an 'oval' negative space, making it easy to slip your arm through. Another distinctive touch: drawstrings on either side of the opening, like little braids, add a playful, whimsical air.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
