    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The new Ivy comes in four shades—'Heather Wood' is a deep brown that channels a somber, earthy sophistication; 'Oak' is a warm light brown with a distinctly autumnal feel; 'Sand Beige' brings a natural, easy-going vibe that underscores a gentle, intellectual elegance; and 'Black' is the timeless, versatile classic that pairs effortlessly with any outfit.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
