      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This group of compact horizontal Ivy bags comes in at 22cm high, 22.5cm wide, and 11cm deep, crafted from supple nappa lambskin that enhances that laid-back, relaxed vibe. The leather undergoes a special antiquing treatment, imparting a naturally aged patina that feels wonderfully nostalgic.",
